            "slug": "jet-scissor-lift-tables",
            "title": "JET Scissor Lift Tables",
            "excerpt": "Manually operated mobile scissor lift tables from JET, rated 330 to 1,650 lb, in standard, jumbo and double-scissor models.",
            "content": "<p>JET's scissor lift tables are light-duty mobile carts for lifting, positioning and moving materials around a shop floor. They are raised with a manually operated hydraulic pump, so they need no power supply.</p>\n<p>The range runs from the compact SLT-330F to the 1,650 lb SLT-1650, and includes the SLT-1100 jumbo table and the DSLT-770, a double scissor model with a raised height over 51 in. Every model rolls on 5 in. casters and carries JET's limited lifetime warranty.</p>",
            "line_code": "SLT / DSLT",
            "capacity_range": "330–1,650 lbs",
            "key_features": [
                "Manually operated hydraulic lift, no power required",
                "Mobile on 5 in. casters with locking wheels",
                "Standard, jumbo and double-scissor models",
                "Limited lifetime warranty"
            ],
